        <p>Thanks to his contributions, numerous educational and social institutions flourished, along with the expansion of mosques and schools that benefited the region's people. Some of his notable projects include:</p>

    
    
    
        <ol><li>A dedicated women’s university within the campus.</li><li>The construction of Darul Hasanah in Rampurhat for orphaned girls.</li><li>The establishment of the largest mosque within the university campus.</li><li>The creation of libraries, such as the Darul Fawz Library in Bhimpur, Ja'fariya School in Khutikul, and Muhammadiyah School in Ramjandrapur.</li></ol></p>

    
    
    
    




